        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Savvy Joinin' Me Crew?"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nTrigger: The ghost reduces a living creature to 0 Hit Points with a melee Strike\n\nThe creature attempts a 25 Fortitude save. If the creature fails its save, it remains conscious but is controlled by the ghost until it loses its dying condition. It continues to attempt recovery checks as normal for the dying condition. The effect ends if the creature loses the dying condition. If the creature dies while under this effect, it joins the ghost's undead crew in 1d4 days. If the ghost is destroyed before the creature dies, the creature is spared this terrible fate."
            },
